---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<PageLayout
  title={`About ${SITE.brand} – Free Browser-Based Tools`}
  description={`About ${SITE.brand}: free PDF, image, calculator, text and QR tools that run in your browser, so your files never leave your device.`}
  h1={`About ${SITE.brand}`}
  path="/about"
>
  <p>
    {SITE.brand} is a collection of free online tools for everyday jobs: working with PDFs and
    images, quick calculations, counting words and making QR codes.
  </p>

  <h2>How the tools work</h2>
  <p>
    Every tool runs inside your web browser. When you choose a file, it is read and processed
    on your own device. It is not uploaded to us or to anyone else. This is the main idea
    behind the site: you should not have to hand over a personal document just to make it
    smaller or change its format.
  </p>

  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>
    <span class="placeholder">[TODO: one or two honest sentences about who you are, e.g. "Built and maintained by NAME, a developer based in COUNTRY."]</span>
  </p>

  <h2>How the site is funded</h2>
  <p>
    The tools are free to use. In the future the site may show advertising to cover running
    costs. Ads will never be given access to the files you process. See the
    <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> for details.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>
    Found a bug or have an idea for a tool? Visit the <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
